<title>USA: NYSE closing averages.</title>
<headline>NYSE closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the New York Stock Exchange closed lower in heavy trading Wednesday.</p>
<p>The Dow Jones Industrial Average fell 55.03 to 6983.18.</p>
<p>The NYSE Composite fell 3.39 to 422.14.</p>
<p>The average price per share fell $0.35.</p>
<p>Losers beat winners 1791 to 750.</p>
<p>Volume was 566,217,380 compared with 527,430,190 on Tuesday.</p>
